  "description": "On a dynaset over T at its first row: Delete, MoveNext, MovePrevious, MoveLast, Delete, MoveNext, MovePrevious, Move 0, reading BOF, EOF, AbsolutePosition and Fields(\"ID\").Value after each call, then RecordCount and the IDs from MoveFirst to EOF. Then the same sequence on a table-type recordset with Index PK_T over the remaining rows (without AbsolutePosition). Asks the current-row state after deleting the first and the last row, and the recovery moves. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
